A '''Xeric's aid (-)''' is a potion that restores the player's [[Hitpoints]] and [[Defence]], while draining the player's [[Strength]], [[Attack]], [[Magic]], and [[Ranged]]. It can be made with 52 [[Herblore]] by using a [[buchu leaf]] with a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while having [[endarkened juice]] in the inventory.

This potion is the weak variant of Xeric's aid, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]].

A Xeric's aid (-) restores Hitpoints by 7% + 1 and Defence by 14% + 1, both rounded down.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1478324637880750083|date=4 January 2021|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/106509|archivedate=6 January 2021|quote=HP: TIER plus ((5 x TIER) + 2) percent. Defence: TIER plus ((4 x TIER) + 10) percent.}} It can heal above the player's maximum Hitpoints level. It temporarily lowers Strength, Attack, Magic and Ranged by 7% + 1. 

==Effects==
===Hitpoints per dose===
The amount of Hitpoints healed is based on a player's base Hitpoints level. The formula is <math display="inline">\left\lfloor \text{Hitpoints} \cdot \frac{7}{100}\right\rfloor + 1</math>.
